{"id":48712,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=48712"},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:21:34","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T14:21:34","slug":"trail-carreiros-do-pastor-arrimalano","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-carreiros-do-pastor-arrimalano\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Carreiros do Pastor Arrimalano 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail Carreiros do Pastor Arrimalano 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail Carreiros do Pastor Arrimalano 2026<\/strong> (10\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se nos dias <strong>21 e 22 de novembro de 2026<\/strong> (s\u00e1bado e domingo), com partida, secretariado e chegada junto ao <strong>Centro Cultural Recreativo e Desportivo de Arrimal<\/strong> (Rua do Outeiro, n\u00ba 15, Arrimal), na Uni\u00e3o de Freguesias de Arrimal e Mendiga, concelho de <strong>Porto de M\u00f3s<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Leiria<\/strong>). No s\u00e1bado, 21 de novembro, disputa-se o <strong>Kids Run<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>15:00<\/strong>, enquanto no domingo, 22 de novembro, ap\u00f3s o briefing \u00e0s 08:50, partem o <strong>Trail Sprint de 20 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong>, o <strong>Mini-Trail de 12 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09:15<\/strong> e a <strong>Caminhada de 10 km<\/strong> \u00e0s <strong>09:20<\/strong>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Inserido no cora\u00e7\u00e3o do <strong>Parque Natural das Serras de Aire e Candeeiros<\/strong>, o evento percorre os trilhos calc\u00e1rios, carreiros pastoris e paisagens emblem\u00e1ticas da Serra dos Candeeiros em redor das lagoas do Arrimal. O <strong>Trail Sprint (20 km, 910m D+)<\/strong> \u00e9 reservado a maiores de 18 anos (tempo limite de 4h00 e dois abastecimentos), o <strong>Mini-Trail (12 km, 350m D+)<\/strong> admite atletas a partir dos 16 anos (tempo limite de 3h00 e um abastecimento), ambos pontu\u00e1veis para o <strong>Trof\u00e9u Trail Porto de M\u00f3s<\/strong>, e a <strong>Caminhada l\u00fadica de 10 km<\/strong> disp\u00f5e de 4h00 de tempo limite. O <strong>Kids Run<\/strong> (3 aos 17 anos) divide-se em seis escal\u00f5es: Bambis (100 m), Sub-10 (300 m), Sub-12 (600 m), Sub-14 (1000 m), Sub-16 (2000 m) e Sub-18 (3000 m).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pelo <strong>CCRD Arrimal e a sua sec\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo\/Trail (Os Morcegos)<\/strong>, com parecer t\u00e9cnico favor\u00e1vel da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Distrital de Atletismo de Leiria (ADAL) e apoio do Munic\u00edpio de Porto de M\u00f3s, o evento inclui saco com brindes, dorsal com chip, seguro desportivo, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, massagem final, balne\u00e1rios e op\u00e7\u00e3o de almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio \u00e0s 13:00, al\u00e9m de pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios (300 \u20ac, 200 \u20ac e 100 \u20ac) para as tr\u00eas equipas mais numerosas. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">21 e 22 de Novembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-wor