12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Rel\u00e2mpago 72h (s\/ almo\u00e7o | c\/ almo\u00e7o: 16 \u20ac):<\/strong> 11.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (primeiras 72h)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">At\u00e9 200 inscritos (s\/ almo\u00e7o | c\/ almo\u00e7o: 21 \u20ac):<\/strong> 16.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 200 vagas)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">+200 inscritos (s\/ almo\u00e7o | c\/ almo\u00e7o: 26 \u20ac):<\/strong> 21.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 17\/11)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Caminhada 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 22 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:20<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase \u00danica (s\/ almo\u00e7o | c\/ almo\u00e7o: 13 \u20ac):<\/strong> 8.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 17\/11)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Kids<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Kids Run (100 m a 3000 m)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 21 Nov \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 15:00<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"color: #34D399; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.1); padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2); display: inline-block;\">Gratuito<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde se realiza o 10\u00ba Trail Carreiros do Pastor Arrimalano 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O 10\u00ba Trail Carreiros do Pastor Arrimalano realiza-se nos dias 21 e 22 de novembro de 2026, com centro nevr\u00e1lgico, secretariado, partida e chegada no Centro Cultural Recreativo e Desportivo de Arrimal (Rua do Outeiro, n\u00ba 15, 2480-043 Arrimal), no concelho de Porto de M\u00f3s, distrito de Leiria.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios de partida, dist\u00e2ncias e desn\u00edveis de cada prova?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">No s\u00e1bado, 21 de novembro, realiza-se o Kids Run \u00e0s 15:00 (escal\u00f5es dos 3 aos 17 anos, entre 100 m e 3000 m). No domingo, 22 de novembro, ap\u00f3s o briefing \u00e0s 08:50, partem o Trail Sprint de 20 km (~910m D+, tempo limite 4h00) \u00e0s 09:00, o Mini-Trail de 12 km (~350m D+, tempo limite 3h00) \u00e0s 09:15 e a Caminhada de 10 km (tempo limite 4h00) \u00e0s 09:20.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e per\u00edodos de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 17 de novembro de 2026 (limite global de 600 vagas, com desconto de 1 \u20ac para atletas federados): na Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Rel\u00e2mpago (primeiras 72h), o Trail Sprint custa 13 \u20ac s\/ refei\u00e7\u00e3o (18 \u20ac c\/ refei\u00e7\u00e3o) e o Mini-Trail 11 \u20ac s\/ refei\u00e7\u00e3o (16 \u20ac c\/ refei\u00e7\u00e3o); at\u00e9 200 inscritos por dist\u00e2ncia, o Trail Sprint custa 18 \u20ac s\/ refei\u00e7\u00e3o (23 \u20ac c\/ refei\u00e7\u00e3o) e o Mini-Trail 16 \u20ac s\/ refei\u00e7\u00e3o (21 \u20ac c\/ refei\u00e7\u00e3o); ap\u00f3s 200 inscritos, o Trail Sprint passa a 23 \u20ac s\/ refei\u00e7\u00e3o (28 \u20ac c\/ refei\u00e7\u00e3o) e o Mini-Trail a 21 \u20ac s\/ refei\u00e7\u00e3o (26 \u20ac c\/ refei\u00e7\u00e3o). A Caminhada custa 8 \u20ac s\/ refei\u00e7\u00e3o (13 \u20ac c\/ refei\u00e7\u00e3o) em todas as fases e o Kids Run \u00e9 gratuito.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e em que hor\u00e1rios funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona na sede do CCRD Arrimal em tr\u00eas per\u00edodos: na sexta-feira (20 de novembro) das 20:00 \u00e0s 23:00, no s\u00e1bado (21 de novembro) das 14:00 \u00e0s 19:00 e no domingo (22 de novembro) das 07:00 \u00e0s 09:10.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o material obrigat\u00f3rio e que pr\u00e9mios coletivos existem?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Em todas as provas \u00e9 obrigat\u00f3rio usar sapatilhas adequadas e telem\u00f3vel operacional; no Trail Sprint e no Mini-Trail \u00e9 tamb\u00e9m obrigat\u00f3rio transportar reservat\u00f3rio de \u00e1gua (n\u00e3o h\u00e1 copos nos abastecimentos), manta t\u00e9rmica e apito (sob pena de 15 minutos de penaliza\u00e7\u00e3o). Al\u00e9m dos trof\u00e9us individuais (Top 3 Geral e Escal\u00f5es) e por equipas (soma dos 4 primeiros atletas), s\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios de 300 \u20ac (1\u00ba), 200 \u20ac (2\u00ba) e 100 \u20ac (3\u00ba) \u00e0s tr\u00eas equipas com maior n\u00famero de atletas inscritos no conjunto do Trail Sprint e Mini-Trail.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail Carreiros do Pastor Arrimalano 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-21\", \"endDate\": \"2026-11-21\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Porto de M\u00f3s, Leiria\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Porto de M\u00f3s\", \"addressRegion\": \"Leiria\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O 10\u00ba Trail Carreiros do Pastor Arrimalano 2026 realiza-se a 21 e 22 de novembro em Arrimal, Porto de M\u00f3s. Provas de 20 km, 12 km, 10 km e Kids. Inscreve-te!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-trail-carreiros-do-pastor-arrimalano.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Sprint 20 km\", \"price\": \"18.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.recordepessoal.pt\/evento\/10trailcarreirosdopastorarrimalano\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Mini-Trail 12 km\", \"price\": \"16.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.recordepessoal.pt\/evento\/10trailcarreirosdopastorarrimalano\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Caminhada 10 km\", \"price\": \"8.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\